# NEW DIALOGUE 02/07/2024 18:23:08

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3131
translate Portugues crackinganaineopen_a314e8f7:

#   yt "It might be enough, but I can't direct Moon fast enough in this situation."
    yt "Pode ser o suficiente, mas não consigo direcionar Moon rápido o suficiente nesta situação."


# NEW DIALOGUE 02/07/2024 18:23:08

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3132
translate Portugues crackinganaineopen_cad1c1a4:

#   yt "I don't know how strong she is yet, so we can't risk hitting him directly either."
    yt "Ainda não sei o quão forte ela é, então também não podemos arriscar acertá-lo diretamente."


# NEW DIALOGUE 02/07/2024 18:23:08

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3135
translate Portugues crackinganaineopen_c979283f:

#   yt "If Moon aims for his hand or the gun, it could cause a reflex that would make him pull the trigger. That would certainly escalate things."
